				<title>So, I just signed a book contract?</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13854431/so-i-just-signed-a-book-contract#post-4812533</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2020 16:43:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>daveyoufool</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2034230</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You might have noticed a slight downtick in the rate of articles I’ve been cranking out for Three Moons and what have you. That has nothing to do with me falling out of love with SCP (Not gonna happen!) and everything to do with the satirical litRPG novel series I’ve been working on: Neverstone.</p> <p>Now, the whole four-book series has been signed with Aethon Books! (Look ‘em up, they're amazing. Nathan Fillion read some of their audiobooks, and Lou Diamond Phillips is one of their authors.)</p> <p>The first book should be out sometime in the next year or two.</p> 
				 	]]>
